Package: excelcompare
Title: Compare Excel Files Cell by Cell
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Paul", "Schmidt", , "pauleschmi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2249-0659"))
Description: Compare Excel files (.xlsx) at the cell level, detecting
    differences in content across all cells including titles, footnotes, and
    annotations. Built on 'tidyxl' for comprehensive cell-by-cell comparison
    that goes beyond tabular data to capture every cell in a worksheet.
